[{:db/id 17592186172130 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-4970a05a-3173-5c58-8ea3-194b8fc59474"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-4970a05a-3173-5c58-8ea3-194b8fc59474" :question/id #uuid "4970a05a-3173-5c58-8ea3-194b8fc59474" :question/math-academy-id "q-161133" :question/problem "$$\n{∬}_{S}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}S={∬}_{D}\\boxed{}\\,\\text{d}A\n$$\n\nConsider the surface integral of the function \n$f(x,y,z)=x+z$ \nover the parametric surface \n\n$$\nr(u,v)=⟨uv,\\,{u}^{2},\\,{v}^{2}⟩\n$$\n\nfor $(u,v)\\in D⊆{R}^{2}.$ What is the missing expression?\n\n*Hint: You can use the fact that $‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖=\\sqrt{16{u}^{2}{v}^{2}+4{v}^{4}+4{u}^{4}}.$*" :question/worked-solution "For a surface $S$ with parametrization $r(u,v)$ for $(u,v)\\in D,$ the surface integral of a scalar function $f$ over $S$ is given by\n\n$$\n{∬}_{S}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}S={∬}_{D}f(r(u,v))‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\nNotice that we are told that the norm of the fundamental vector product for our surface is\n\n$$\n‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖=\\sqrt{16{u}^{2}{v}^{2}+4{v}^{4}+4{u}^{4}}.\n$$\n\nNext, we substitute the coordinate expressions of $r(u,v)$ into $f(x,y,z):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(r(u,v)) & =(x+z)\\,{|}_{x=uv\\,y={u}^{2}\\,z={v}^{2}} \\\\  & =uv+{v}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the surface integral can be written as \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}S & ={∬}_{D}f(r(u,v))‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}\\,(uv+{v}^{2})\\sqrt{16{u}^{2}{v}^{2}+4{v}^{4}+4{u}^{4}}\\,\\,\\text{d}A.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-39e51a49-d535-578a-8167-c77ca61f8305"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-39e51a49-d535-578a-8167-c77ca61f8305" :answer-field/id #uuid "39e51a49-d535-578a-8167-c77ca61f8305" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-8e82d031-e34f-52ca-aadf-8e8d59c47bb2" :answer-field/choices ["answer-bf1e4b2c-7a9b-5b87-a6e2-85dd90a414fd" "answer-8e82d031-e34f-52ca-aadf-8e8d59c47bb2" "answer-bdf13d7f-d54d-59f5-9209-239de83443e0" "answer-1796399c-8c6d-5f22-bede-36efd1a03f5a" "answer-d04576fc-a1ab-5d09-bca6-54a80b70447c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-bf1e4b2c-7a9b-5b87-a6e2-85dd90a414fd" :answer/id #uuid "bf1e4b2c-7a9b-5b87-a6e2-85dd90a414fd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(uv+{u}^{2})\\sqrt{16{u}^{2}{v}^{2}+4{v}^{2}+4{u}^{4}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8e82d031-e34f-52ca-aadf-8e8d59c47bb2" :answer/id #uuid "8e82d031-e34f-52ca-aadf-8e8d59c47bb2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(uv+{v}^{2})\\sqrt{16{u}^{2}{v}^{2}+4{v}^{4}+4{u}^{4}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-bdf13d7f-d54d-59f5-9209-239de83443e0" :answer/id #uuid "bdf13d7f-d54d-59f5-9209-239de83443e0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(v+{v}^{2})\\sqrt{16{u}^{2}{v}^{2}+4{v}^{2}+4{u}^{4}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1796399c-8c6d-5f22-bede-36efd1a03f5a" :answer/id #uuid "1796399c-8c6d-5f22-bede-36efd1a03f5a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "uv\\sqrt{{u}^{2}{v}^{2}+4{v}^{4}+4{u}^{4}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d04576fc-a1ab-5d09-bca6-54a80b70447c" :answer/id #uuid "d04576fc-a1ab-5d09-bca6-54a80b70447c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{v}^{2}\\sqrt{{u}^{2}{v}^{2}+4{v}^{4}+4{u}^{4}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]}]
